WEBVTT

00:06:29.051 --> 00:06:32.888
will aid early diagnosis of cancer
and brain diseases,

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:35.808
ultimately benefiting global health.

00:06:36.767 --> 00:06:40.980
I hope you all can share my excitement
over this fast-growing field

00:06:41.021 --> 00:06:44.775
and hope you'll join us
in advancing the technology.

00:06:45.484 --> 00:06:46.652
Thank you.

00:06:46.652 --> 00:06:49.947
(Applause)